WEBVTT

00:01:49.060 --> 00:01:51.560
﻿No. I don't like it!

00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:53.270
﻿Why don't you get it?

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:55.100
﻿You can say that all you want, but—

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:56.480
﻿What's with her?

00:01:56.480 --> 00:01:58.520
﻿She won't calm down!

00:02:00.070 --> 00:02:01.020
﻿Raraiya, hold your horses!

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:04.950
﻿What's going on?

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:11.990
﻿You stop that!

00:02:12.660 --> 00:02:14.830
﻿Is Raraiya trying to break it?

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:16.040
﻿What is she breaking?

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:18.540
﻿I don't like this thing! Take it off!

00:02:18.540 --> 00:02:21.750
- G doesn't like it! I don't like it!
- Calm down!

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:23.800
﻿Raraiya, stop!

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:26.300
﻿I'm against it too.

00:02:26.310 --> 00:02:27.270
G!

00:02:28.140 --> 00:02:31.890
﻿You don't like seeing the G-Self
﻿wrapped in the Assault Pack, right?

00:02:32.640 --> 00:02:33.850
﻿Bell!

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:36.310
﻿- I don't like it!
- ﻿Well, too bad!

00:02:37.020 --> 00:02:39.810
﻿- Don't move.
﻿- Be a good girl.

00:02:40.270 --> 00:02:41.520
﻿She's strong!

00:02:41.520 --> 00:02:43.020
﻿What's wrong with her?

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:45.440
﻿She says the G-Self isn't free!

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:48.280
﻿Oh, I can kind of understand that.

00:02:48.820 --> 00:02:49.950
﻿Okay!

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:53.330
﻿- Don't be selfish!
- ﻿Adrenaline, rising! Rising! Rising!

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:55.450
<i>﻿I see what she wants.</i>

00:02:55.450 --> 00:02:59.040
﻿Raraiya feels that way because
﻿she knows the G-Self.

00:02:59.420 --> 00:03:01.920
﻿I've started to understand what she's saying,

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:07.090
﻿but I installed the Assault Pack with
﻿your next battlefield in mind.

00:03:07.090 --> 00:03:09.220
﻿My next battlefield?

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:11.050
﻿Is that something you decide, Mr. Happa?

00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:14.470
﻿It's because I took part in
﻿the intercontinental war.

00:03:14.470 --> 00:03:17.730
﻿I have more experience with war
﻿than you or Lieutenant Kerbes.

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:18.730
﻿Right.

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:20.940
﻿We're close to geostationary
﻿satellite orbit,

00:03:20.940 --> 00:03:23.860
﻿so long range combat potential
﻿should be prioritized.

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:27.320
﻿Mobile Suits are meant for close combat.

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:30.820
﻿That's why I'm enabling
﻿the G-Self to use this.

00:03:30.820 --> 00:03:34.080
﻿Was that built at the Caribbean
﻿Laboratory on the island?

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:38.160
﻿They built it and all, but it turned out
﻿the Arcane and Grimoire couldn't use it.

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:40.580
﻿- Why?
- ﻿If you want to know,

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:43.130
﻿ask the guy who drafted the
﻿Rose of Hermes Blueprints!

00:03:44.960 --> 00:03:48.510
﻿Read through that over lunch or something.
﻿You should be able to use this.

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:52.390
But this is too big. The G-Self
﻿will get thrown around by it.

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:54.220
﻿You've got that backwards.

00:03:54.220 --> 00:03:57.350
﻿You'll use the Assault Pack's
﻿position control system.

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:58.850
﻿Oh, okay!

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:01.310
﻿You know, as long as I've got
﻿to be assigned to this ship...

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:03.020
﻿Huh? Then what?

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:05.980
﻿I want you to protect me!

00:04:07.490 --> 00:04:08.690
﻿I'll go read it!

00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:14.030
﻿Chuchumy...

00:04:14.030 --> 00:04:15.990
﻿Maybe it's wearing things things like this

00:04:15.990 --> 00:04:17.870
﻿that's triggering her memories.

00:04:17.870 --> 00:04:20.710
﻿Ah, is that possible?

00:04:20.710 --> 00:04:22.120
﻿It must be.

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:24.830
﻿She's the girl who fell to Earth on a Monday.

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:30.300
﻿Huh? Assault can also refer
﻿to beating up someone!

00:04:35.890 --> 00:04:38.310
﻿Return to the Salamandra, keeping
the Hecate on your right.

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:40.560
﻿You're drifting northwards.

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:42.310
﻿Don't get distracted by other ships!

00:04:42.310 --> 00:04:45.310
﻿Yes, ma'am! Salamandra, Vanguard 1!

00:04:45.310 --> 00:04:47.570
﻿- Vanguard 2!
﻿- Vanguard 3!

00:04:51.820 --> 00:04:53.740
﻿They've gotten pretty used to this.

00:04:54.320 --> 00:04:57.200
﻿It's giving me high hopes
﻿for your next battle.

00:04:57.200 --> 00:05:01.450
﻿At the first nut's altitude, we were under
﻿the restrictions of geocentric orbit.

00:05:01.460 --> 00:05:02.960
﻿Maybe they were unable to fight freely?

00:05:02.960 --> 00:05:05.380
﻿The gravity is harsh, after all.

00:05:05.380 --> 00:05:09.090
﻿But, at Sankt Porto's orbit
﻿we are actually in space.

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:12.300
﻿Still, wouldn't connecting the Gavial
﻿to them be impossible?

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:14.050
﻿It's a supply ship, you know?

00:05:14.050 --> 00:05:16.220
﻿That works to our advantage.

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:19.600
﻿Captain Klim found this.

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:22.430
﻿Capital Tower's space charter?

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:23.980
﻿That part.

00:05:24.810 --> 00:05:28.480
﻿"Aid must be rendered to a disabled Beagle."

00:05:28.820 --> 00:05:31.610
﻿They don't define what a Beagle is,

00:05:31.610 --> 00:05:33.240
﻿so if we made it look like we're stranded...

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:36.820
﻿If the Gavial crew is able
﻿to get into Sankt Porto,

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:38.490
﻿we can take it intact.

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:41.910
﻿So, I'd like us to look like a ship in distress.

00:05:41.910 --> 00:05:44.870
﻿Putting out smoke, or flooded, perhaps.

00:05:45.290 --> 00:05:48.880
﻿I would ask you to put on your best
﻿dramatic performance to that end.

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:52.840
﻿We have two or three soldiers
﻿who were good at that in school.

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:53.880
﻿Later then.

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:17.740
﻿At present, this ship, the Salamandra,

00:06:17.740 --> 00:06:19.950
﻿is en route to Sankt Porto.

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:24.080
﻿That's the nut at the top
﻿of the Capital Tower, right?

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:27.040
﻿If we go there in a warship,
﻿we'll all die in agony!

00:06:27.040 --> 00:06:28.500
﻿- She's right!
- ﻿It's unthinkable!

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:31.000
﻿It's the most holy site in SU-Cordism!

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:33.210
﻿I'm against doing anything
﻿that would get us cursed!

00:06:33.210 --> 00:06:35.130
﻿We will be occupying it,

00:06:35.130 --> 00:06:36.930
﻿so there is no way they can curse us!

00:06:37.760 --> 00:06:39.680
﻿Are we taking it for Ameria?

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:44.270
﻿The ship pursuing us, the Garanden,
﻿seems to have launched Mobile Suits.

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:46.810
﻿- That would be Mask's unit.
- ﻿Yes.

00:06:46.810 --> 00:06:50.810
﻿All Mobile Suits, get in
﻿position to defend this ship.

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:53.150
﻿Further, until we are aware
﻿of the enemy's situation

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:55.900
﻿do not spread Minovsky Particles!

00:07:01.530 --> 00:07:06.080
﻿I failed to take back the G-Self
﻿while Colonel Cumpa was watching,

00:07:06.080 --> 00:07:10.120
﻿so I'll crush the Amerian Army's
﻿advance guard here and redeem myself!

00:07:13.800 --> 00:07:16.550
﻿You have picked them up on radar, yes?

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:19.340
﻿They've entered combat range.

00:07:19.340 --> 00:07:21.890
﻿What is the Megafauna doing?

00:07:21.890 --> 00:07:24.430
﻿It's still not in combat range.

00:07:24.430 --> 00:07:27.060
﻿- But...
- ﻿But what?

00:07:27.060 --> 00:07:29.520
﻿One unit that looks like a
﻿Mobile Suit has launched.

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:32.480
﻿One, you said? That cannot be right!

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:37.070
﻿Mick! Send me all the data before
﻿Minovsky Particles are spread!

00:07:37.070 --> 00:07:42.780
﻿XO, the main Rattle-Python force is
﻿already above Sankt Porto, right?!

00:07:42.780 --> 00:07:46.120
﻿Gusion said something about coming
﻿out once the Gavial connects.

00:07:46.120 --> 00:07:48.080
﻿Leveling ship!

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:50.000
﻿Mobile Suits, go ahead!

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:57.460
﻿There's still another five pages?

00:07:57.460 --> 00:07:59.590
Oh! I finished reading the whole manual!

00:08:00.260 --> 00:08:02.390
﻿- Ow!
﻿- Arcane, heading out!

00:08:02.390 --> 00:08:03.970
﻿Huh? Then...

00:08:08.600 --> 00:08:10.480
﻿Bell, I'll hold on to you.

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:12.730
﻿Go ahead. I'll be accelerating though.

00:08:12.730 --> 00:08:14.400
﻿I'll match your speed.

00:08:18.320 --> 00:08:21.150
﻿The Salamandra should be above
﻿and to the left of the sun.

00:08:21.910 --> 00:08:23.410
﻿Direction confirmed.

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:26.160
﻿The Garanden is pursuing them
﻿with Mask's unit on board.

00:08:26.160 --> 00:08:28.240
﻿They're the ones with those
﻿doll-like suits, right?

00:08:28.250 --> 00:08:29.700
﻿Yes.

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:33.250
﻿If the Salamandra is taken out, it
﻿would be a problem for your dad, right?

00:08:33.250 --> 00:08:36.130
﻿Though Dad's come up
﻿aboard the Rattle-Python,

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:38.880
﻿he can't keep Genius Klim's
﻿hyperactivity under control.

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:42.630
﻿We just have to stop the Mask Corps's attack.

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:45.470
﻿- Ah. Thank you.
- ﻿For what?

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:48.720
﻿The Mask Corps is part of the Capital Army.

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:50.980
﻿I was impressed to see you're
﻿still resolved to do this.

00:08:51.890 --> 00:08:54.190
﻿Well, what choice do I have?

00:08:58.280 --> 00:09:03.950
﻿Place us on a straight line between
﻿the pursuing suits and Capital Tower.

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:07.120
﻿If we get the Capital Tower in front of us,

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:09.830
﻿the enemy behind us can't
﻿make long range attacks.

00:09:09.830 --> 00:09:13.710
﻿In that case, are we going to reach
﻿there before the Rattle-Python?

00:09:13.710 --> 00:09:16.500
﻿That's right. It won't be
﻿Inspector General Gusion.

00:09:16.500 --> 00:09:18.420
﻿We'll be the first ones there!

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:26.340
﻿Message for you! Two Mobile Suits
﻿have come out of the Megafauna.

00:09:26.350 --> 00:09:27.680
﻿So the Arcane came out too.

00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:30.060
﻿They should be able to rendezvous with us.

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:32.640
﻿You get to fight alongside Miss Aida.

00:09:32.640 --> 00:09:34.140
﻿You must be thrilled.

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:36.440
﻿She is not particularly capable.

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:39.020
﻿The G-Arcane should be an
﻿asset in battle though.

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:42.360
﻿- Don't get your hopes up!
- ﻿What are you so mad for?

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:48.240
﻿- Keep long range missiles on standby.
- ﻿Roger that!

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:55.870
﻿Barara, if you were to activate
﻿the missiles' Photon Eye...

00:09:55.870 --> 00:09:59.790
﻿Yeah, even if there are Minovsky Particles,
﻿they can pursue their target.

00:10:02.260 --> 00:10:04.340
﻿Hold up, Bell!

00:10:04.340 --> 00:10:07.930
﻿Even if we know the Mask Corps's
﻿position from digital imaging,

00:10:07.930 --> 00:10:09.680
﻿its only an estimate!

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:14.310
﻿Even if we can't snipe them, we can make
﻿them halt their attack on the Salamandra.

00:10:14.310 --> 00:10:15.890
﻿Happa's prediction was on the mark.

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:18.900
﻿I'll be able to use the Assault
﻿Pack for long range combat.

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:20.940
﻿The Assault Pack's Photon Eye...

00:10:20.940 --> 00:10:22.400
﻿Is it reliable?

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:24.150
﻿Huh? Well...

00:10:24.150 --> 00:10:26.650
﻿I trust Mr. Happa's maintenance!

00:10:26.660 --> 00:10:30.200
﻿Sankt Porto is in the line
﻿of fire as well, right?

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:32.160
﻿It's much further away.

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:36.160
﻿That said, this thing's firing ability
﻿is an unknown. It's not going to hit.

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:38.670
﻿What comes next may be bad.

00:10:39.540 --> 00:10:41.090
﻿Really?

00:10:41.090 --> 00:10:42.090
﻿And the Megafauna?

00:10:43.550 --> 00:10:45.800
﻿There's no way we could see it, huh?

00:10:46.300 --> 00:10:48.300
﻿Bell, I'm counting on you.

00:10:50.300 --> 00:10:52.140
﻿There will be no second battle!

00:10:52.140 --> 00:10:54.560
﻿Execute the operation to regain our honor!

00:10:54.560 --> 00:10:56.270
Taking aim.

00:10:56.270 --> 00:10:58.020
﻿Setting timer

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:00.810
﻿Sankt Porto is in the background,

00:11:00.810 --> 00:11:03.900
﻿and the Salamandra is taking
﻿a zig-zag course, but...

00:11:04.780 --> 00:11:07.110
﻿Go! Watch this!

00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:15.200
﻿Even if this can't take down
﻿any Mobile Suits...!

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:23.460
﻿There are four lights pursuing us!

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:26.090
﻿You should give orders to intercept first!

00:11:26.090 --> 00:11:28.090
﻿Mobile Suits, respond to them!

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:31.640
﻿Viper-Viper, put up a wall
﻿of fire to intercept them!

00:11:31.640 --> 00:11:33.350
﻿Don't catch our allies in the crossfire!

00:12:03.420 --> 00:12:06.220
﻿Beams and missiles came
﻿from our flank to help us.

00:12:06.220 --> 00:12:08.680
﻿Did Klim and his men defend us?

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:10.260
﻿It came from an entirely different direction!

00:12:18.610 --> 00:12:20.230
﻿Why do I see explosions?

00:12:20.230 --> 00:12:21.860
﻿They were shooting at the Salamandra!

00:12:21.860 --> 00:12:26.490
﻿Did Mask go after the ship to avoid
﻿a Mobile Suit battle? How dirty!

00:12:32.990 --> 00:12:35.080
﻿The Salamandra is intact, you say?!

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:38.330
﻿If someone interfered...
﻿It must be him again!

00:12:41.210 --> 00:12:43.340
﻿Judging by the direction of the beam...

00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:47.510
﻿Captain, the guy who got in
﻿our way is in front of me!

00:12:47.510 --> 00:12:48.970
﻿Roger that,

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:52.350
﻿but the Salamandra has currently sent
﻿out an advance party to Sankt Porto.

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:54.010
﻿Its defenses are thin.

00:12:56.270 --> 00:12:58.940
﻿- Aren't they coming?
﻿- They seem to be on the move at least.

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:01.150
﻿On my pride as a Kuntala,

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:03.940
﻿I swear I will sink the Salamandra
﻿with this Mack Knife!

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:06.940
﻿- Enemy machine ahead!
- ﻿Fire all weapons!

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:13.530
﻿Your defenses aren't good enough!

00:13:16.500 --> 00:13:18.750
﻿A warship can't beat an aircraft.

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:29.260
﻿The Elf behind me got taken out?

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:30.720
﻿Did reinforcements arrive?

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:34.640
﻿Mask, the Salamandra's Mobile
﻿Suits have come back!

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:40.100
﻿Your upstart military force
﻿could never sink a battleship!

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:42.730
﻿Klim! Talk less, shoot more!

00:13:48.030 --> 00:13:49.190
﻿Oh, there!

00:13:52.780 --> 00:13:55.410
﻿Impressive gall. You have my compliments.

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:01.290
﻿I won't let you lowly Amerians
﻿kill my subordinates!

00:14:03.750 --> 00:14:04.630
﻿What?

00:14:06.380 --> 00:14:09.130
﻿G-Self! What are you plotting?

00:14:09.130 --> 00:14:10.720
﻿He's here?

00:14:10.720 --> 00:14:13.140
﻿Did you have to bring Miss Aida?

00:14:13.140 --> 00:14:18.180
﻿It looks like the Capital Army's figured
﻿out how to put together a mixed unit now!

00:14:28.530 --> 00:14:30.030
﻿Bell! Bell!

00:14:30.030 --> 00:14:31.740
﻿What is it?

00:14:32.280 --> 00:14:33.990
﻿Bellri! What's wrong?

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:37.870
﻿- Captain!
- ﻿An ally?

00:14:44.210 --> 00:14:45.580
﻿You can't act like that, Captain.

00:14:45.590 --> 00:14:47.290
﻿Your impatience is clear to see.

00:14:47.300 --> 00:14:49.460
﻿You'll get taken out by the
﻿blue Jahannam like that.

00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:51.300
﻿You people!

00:14:51.300 --> 00:14:54.630
﻿How could you fight a Mobile Suit battle
﻿with Sankt Porto right in front of us?

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:56.760
﻿These aren't the actions of human beings!

00:14:56.800 --> 00:14:59.720
﻿Oh, right. Bell.

00:15:04.230 --> 00:15:06.560
﻿In order to occupy Sankt Porto,

00:15:06.560 --> 00:15:09.320
﻿we have no choice but to fight here!

00:15:12.360 --> 00:15:14.990
﻿This would be a good time to head
﻿back to the Salamandra.

00:15:14.990 --> 00:15:18.280
﻿- Well, yes, but...!
﻿- The Mask Corps are doing the same!

00:15:19.330 --> 00:15:21.700
﻿Don't shoot down our
﻿allies with support fire!

00:15:21.700 --> 00:15:25.870
﻿The Amerian Army being able to fight a
﻿battle that will end up in the history books?

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:27.880
﻿I'm moved.

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:31.630
﻿Collect our Mobile Suits
﻿as we head for Sankt Porto.

00:15:31.630 --> 00:15:34.970
﻿Captain! Write your ship's log later!

00:15:34.970 --> 00:15:38.760
﻿Once Sankt Porto is in firing
﻿range, we can't fight!

00:15:38.760 --> 00:15:43.640
﻿Garanden! Head for the Capital
﻿Tower as per the original plan.

00:15:48.480 --> 00:15:50.940
﻿Bellri, we're returning to the Megafauna.

00:15:50.940 --> 00:15:52.150
﻿Oh, sure.

00:15:53.070 --> 00:15:56.030
﻿We'll enter Sankt Porto aboard the Megafauna.

00:15:56.030 --> 00:15:58.820
﻿What?! We can't do that!

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:02.290
﻿Not even Capital Guard machines
﻿can get in from outside!

00:16:02.290 --> 00:16:04.750
﻿Huh? Is that how it is?

00:16:04.750 --> 00:16:06.210
﻿Then...

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:08.130
﻿The nut below Sankt Porto.

00:16:08.130 --> 00:16:10.500
﻿We can get in through Nut #144, right?

00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:12.170
﻿Oh, yeah!

00:16:12.170 --> 00:16:13.840
﻿There's a wharf there,

00:16:13.840 --> 00:16:16.470
﻿and Lieutenant Kerbes should be
﻿able to get us clearance to enter.

00:16:19.140 --> 00:16:20.100
﻿Captain!

00:16:20.890 --> 00:16:25.100
﻿I would like you to inform Commander Jugan
﻿that we'll be sticking close to Capital Tower.

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:28.980
﻿The Gavial seems to have been
﻿accepted into Sankt Porto.

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:32.770
That's all the more reason
why we need reinforcements.

00:16:32.780 --> 00:16:35.860
﻿We will have to have Colonel Cumpa
arrange that for us.

00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:39.240
﻿More. Just a little! Just a little!

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:42.030
﻿All right! Stop!

00:16:45.330 --> 00:16:46.620
﻿Now, listen here.

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:52.290
﻿We know that His Holiness and Director Wilmit
﻿have gone up to Sankt Porto.

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:58.680
﻿Even if that is the case, we have only
﻿confirmed your and Bellri Zenam's IDs.

00:16:58.680 --> 00:17:00.680
﻿The Megafauna was accepted
﻿as a ship in distress.

00:17:00.680 --> 00:17:03.560
﻿It will not be allowed to
﻿move to any other port.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:09.270
- ﻿Director Wilmit in Sankt Porto will—
- ﻿About that! Hurry it up, will you?

00:17:09.270 --> 00:17:12.940
﻿I thought I could sweet talk
﻿them into letting us go up.

00:17:13.270 --> 00:17:14.940
﻿They don't know about the battle,

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:18.360
﻿or that the Amerian Army
﻿got into Sankt Porto.

00:17:18.360 --> 00:17:21.780
﻿- What's with that?
- ﻿That's just how the Capital Guard is.

00:17:21.780 --> 00:17:23.330
﻿You're going to get yourself slapped again.

00:17:23.620 --> 00:17:25.160
﻿They could be fakes.

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:27.000
﻿I doubt it!

00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:29.290
﻿I'll try going up in the Arcane.

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:31.040
﻿Then I'll go as well.

00:17:31.830 --> 00:17:35.050
﻿Those people aren't going to
﻿see our side of things.

00:17:35.050 --> 00:17:36.380
﻿Well, yeah.

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:40.050
﻿Is it true that the Salamandra
﻿was let into Sankt Porto?

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:42.680
﻿They must've used the Gavial
﻿as a pretext to go in.

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:46.100
﻿Then they've occupied it! Those cursed fools!

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:50.390
﻿Ameria is trying to liberate Capital
﻿Tower for the sake of all mankind!

00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:53.940
﻿Right now, finding out what's going
﻿on in Sankt Porto comes first.

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:56.110
﻿We'll go there with two Mobile Suits.

00:17:58.320 --> 00:18:00.110
﻿It's inside Chuchumy.

00:18:01.700 --> 00:18:03.110
﻿The Crown is coming.

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:19.510
﻿Sankt Porto is close now.

00:18:23.340 --> 00:18:25.010
﻿That's Sankt Porto?

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:27.390
﻿We are over capacity.

00:18:27.390 --> 00:18:30.390
﻿- Those are Amerian Mobile Suits.
- ﻿There's a whole lot of them.

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:36.270
﻿Genius Klim...

00:18:36.270 --> 00:18:39.570
﻿Did he do something particularly
﻿violent to get inside?

00:18:39.570 --> 00:18:40.900
﻿If they're Amerian...

00:18:52.670 --> 00:18:54.920
﻿B-Bear with it for now.

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:56.920
﻿They'll let us pass.

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:07.720
﻿If it isn't the G-Arcane!

00:19:07.720 --> 00:19:09.930
﻿Miss Aida has come to join us!

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:18.440
﻿Miss Aida's Arcane is tugging the G-Self.

00:19:18.440 --> 00:19:21.110
﻿What? Yes.

00:19:21.110 --> 00:19:22.690
﻿The G-Self is tied up.

00:19:25.950 --> 00:19:29.450
﻿We just arrived as well, so Captain Klim
﻿won't be able to enter until—

00:19:29.450 --> 00:19:31.240
﻿Don't run!

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:34.910
﻿Captain Klim went with
﻿Gusion to meet the pope.

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:36.880
﻿My father is here as well?

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:38.710
﻿He came with the Rattle-Python.

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:39.920
﻿Where are they?

00:19:39.920 --> 00:19:44.260
﻿Leave here and take the elevator
﻿up to the port entrance building.

00:19:44.260 --> 00:19:46.890
- ﻿It's just outside.
﻿-Ah, thanks.

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:51.390
- ﻿Your mother will be with the pope, right?
- ﻿Elevator.

00:19:51.850 --> 00:19:53.520
﻿They're probably together.

00:19:55.390 --> 00:19:57.100
﻿Going up.

00:20:02.780 --> 00:20:04.780
﻿One card per person.

00:20:08.200 --> 00:20:10.450
﻿This is a space colony?

00:20:13.910 --> 00:20:18.080
﻿With a rental Shank, it's just
﻿five minutes to the cathedral.

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:21.250
﻿Oh, they call it the Communion Room as well.

00:20:30.640 --> 00:20:34.600
﻿You people have a lot of gall.
﻿You even brought Inspector General Gusion...

00:20:34.730 --> 00:20:37.640
﻿This will not be easy to
﻿forgive. It's intolerable.

00:20:37.650 --> 00:20:39.190
﻿Inspector General Gusion,

00:20:39.190 --> 00:20:43.190
﻿you let this hyperactive child drag you
﻿into this. I had thought better of you.

00:20:46.150 --> 00:20:47.400
﻿This is tedious!

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:50.910
﻿That we have brought our
﻿fleet here to Sankt Porto,

00:20:50.910 --> 00:20:54.790
shows that Ameria has the ability
﻿to manage this place, does it not?

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:58.620
﻿What do you say? With the
﻿situation developing as it is,

00:20:58.620 --> 00:21:00.460
﻿we ask for your allowance.

00:21:00.460 --> 00:21:02.000
﻿We can't have that.

00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:04.590
﻿It's not even the Soul Festival now.

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:07.590
﻿It's an exception among exceptions
﻿that His Holiness has come up here.

00:21:07.590 --> 00:21:13.560
﻿Father, didn't you come here to
﻿negate the threat from space?

00:21:13.760 --> 00:21:15.680
﻿- Aida!
﻿- Bell!

00:21:16.020 --> 00:21:17.430
<i>﻿These two...</i>

00:21:17.440 --> 00:21:18.770
﻿Before that,

00:21:18.770 --> 00:21:22.270
﻿we must take control of the Photon
﻿Battery distribution system.

00:21:22.270 --> 00:21:24.020
﻿Otherwise we will be unable
﻿to face the threat!

00:21:24.020 --> 00:21:26.320
﻿The management of Capital Tower

00:21:26.320 --> 00:21:29.780
﻿is a duty entrusted to <i>me</i> by SU-Cordism.

00:21:29.780 --> 00:21:31.280
﻿Mom!

00:21:31.280 --> 00:21:34.660
﻿Young one, you wish to
﻿use Towasanga's power—

00:21:34.660 --> 00:21:36.540
﻿Those people in Towasanga

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:40.210
﻿come from Universal Century survivors who
﻿made up the Hermes Foundation and—

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:44.670
﻿Emergency live! Reactivating
﻿and connecting in six seconds.

00:21:45.420 --> 00:21:47.630
﻿Reactivating and connecting in six seconds.

00:21:47.630 --> 00:21:49.670
﻿Direction SS. 11 degrees.

00:21:49.680 --> 00:21:51.550
﻿The Gavial was shot down!

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:55.430
﻿So the threat in space was real!

00:21:55.430 --> 00:21:56.680
﻿No, that's not it.

00:21:56.680 --> 00:22:00.940
﻿If it really was they'd
﻿have attacked here first.

00:22:00.940 --> 00:22:03.770
﻿The Gavial was in the
﻿space above Sankt Porto.

00:22:03.770 --> 00:22:05.940
﻿Then, that must have been a warning.

00:22:05.940 --> 00:22:08.400
- ﻿A warning?
- ﻿﻿A warning?

00:22:08.400 --> 00:22:09.860
﻿A warning?

00:24:00.040 --> 00:24:02.840
﻿We were shocked by the
﻿appearance of a new enemy,

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:04.630
﻿but the bigger shock

00:24:04.630 --> 00:24:09.510
﻿was that we put up a common front against
﻿them with Mask and Klim's units.

00:24:09.680 --> 00:24:13.890
﻿When Captain Klim and Mask
﻿end up on the same elevator,

00:24:13.890 --> 00:24:17.020
﻿they were overcome by the scent of the girls.

00:24:17.020 --> 00:24:18.900
﻿That was a mess!

00:24:19.520 --> 00:24:21.560
﻿Next time on Reconguista in G,

00:24:21.570 --> 00:24:23.570
﻿Those Who Came From the Moon.

00:24:23.570 --> 00:24:25.820
﻿If you don't watch, you'll
﻿never understand anything!
